       01 WS-FIRE-INDEX                          GLOBAL    PIC 9.
       01 WS-SMOKE-PUFFS                         GLOBAL.
           05 WS-PUFF                            OCCURS 12.
               10 WS-PUFF-NODE                   PIC 9(10).
               10 WS-PUFF-HEIGHT                 PIC S9(4)V9(4).
       01 WS-PUFF-INDEX                          GLOBAL    PIC 99.

      *> Placing a piece: its origin and turn, a box or point in its own frame, and that point in the world.
       01 WS-ORIGIN-X                            GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4).
       01 WS-ORIGIN-Z                            GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4).
       01 WS-TURN                                GLOBAL    PIC 999.
