       01 WS-HALF-DEPTH                          GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4).
       01 WS-NODE                                GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-PART                                GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-MATERIAL                            GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).

      *> The player: position, view, health and the two weapons (1 AR-15, 2 Desert Eagle).
       01 WS-CAMERA                              GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-SUN                                 GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-PLAYER-X                            GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4)  VALUE -3.
       01 WS-PLAYER-Z                            GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4)  VALUE 12.
       01 WS-TRY-X                               GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4).
