       01 WS-FORWARD                             GLOBAL    PIC S9.
       01 WS-SIDEWAYS                            GLOBAL    PIC S9.
       01 WS-YAW                                 GLOBAL    PIC S9(5)V9(4)  VALUE 0.
       01 WS-PITCH                               GLOBAL    PIC S9(3)V9(4)  VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SINE                                GLOBAL    PIC S9V9(6).
