       01 WS-LAST-POINTER-Y                      GLOBAL    PIC S9(5).
       01 WS-LOOK-READY                          GLOBAL    PIC 9           VALUE 0.
       01 WS-HEALTH                              GLOBAL    PIC S9(3)V9(2)  VALUE 100.
       01 WS-DEAD-FRAMES                         GLOBAL    PIC 9(5)        VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DAMAGE                              GLOBAL    PIC S9(3)V9(2).
       01 WS-DAMAGE-FRAMES                       GLOBAL    PIC 99          VALUE 0.
       01 WS-WEAPON                              GLOBAL    PIC 9           VALUE 1.
