      *> A shot: where the bullet went, what Pick found there.
       01 WS-AIM-X                               GLOBAL    PIC S9(5)V9(2).
       01 WS-AIM-Y                               GLOBAL    PIC S9(5)V9(2).
       01 WS-ANSWER                              GLOBAL    PIC X(400).
       01 WS-FIELDS                              GLOBAL.
