       01 WS-HIT-NODE                            GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-HIT-DISTANCE                        GLOBAL    PIC S9(5)V9(4).
       01 WS-HIT-X                               GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4).
