      *> What a round flies through: smoke, flames, flashes, the spark, the marks, the projectiles and the player's own weapon.
      *> They are hidden while Pick looks for the first solid surface, then shown again as they were.
       01 WS-SEE-THROUGH                         GLOBAL.
           05 WS-CLEAR                           OCCURS 48.
               10 WS-CLEAR-NODE                  PIC 9(10).
               10 WS-CLEAR-SHOWN                 PIC 9.
       01 WS-CLEAR-COUNT                         GLOBAL    PIC 99          VALUE 0.
       01 WS-CLEAR-INDEX                         GLOBAL    PIC 99.

      *> Being found. The attackers search for five seconds (150 frames) before they spot a player in the open; a player
      *> inside a building or a container is found only by chance; one who stays hidden five seconds after being spotted is
      *> lost again. They aim at WS-MARK: the player once spotted, the last place the player was seen while hiding, and a
      *> place nearby that changes every four seconds while they search.
       01 WS-SPOTTED                             GLOBAL    PIC 9           VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SEARCH-FRAMES                       GLOBAL    PIC 999         VALUE 0.
       01 WS-LOST-FRAMES                         GLOBAL    PIC 999         VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SEARCH-WAIT                         GLOBAL    PIC S999        VALUE 0.
       01 WS-MARK-X                              GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4)  VALUE 0.
       01 WS-MARK-Z                              GLOBAL    PIC S9(4)V9(4)  VALUE 0.
       01 WS-ATTACKERS                           GLOBAL    PIC 9           VALUE 0.
       01 WS-CLOSE-DRONE                         GLOBAL    PIC 9           VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SHOW-SECONDS                        GLOBAL    PIC 9.9.

      *> Bullet marks and scorch marks: one plane each, drawn once per matrix (SetInstances), recycled oldest first.
       01 WS-DECAL-NODE                          GLOBAL    PIC 9(10).
       01 WS-DECAL-SEGMENTS                      GLOBAL.
           05 WS-DECAL-SEGMENT                   PIC X(180)  OCCURS 64.
       01 WS-DECAL-COUNT                         GLOBAL    PIC 99          VALUE 0.
