               10 WS-TANK-HEALTH                 PIC S99.
               10 WS-TANK-RELOAD                 PIC S9(4).
               10 WS-TANK-WAIT                   PIC S9(4).
       01 WS-TANK-INDEX                          GLOBAL    PIC 9.
       01 WS-HELICOPTERS                         GLOBAL.
           05 WS-HELICOPTER                      OCCURS 2.
               10 WS-HELI-ROOT                   PIC 9(10).
